      ],
      "en": "Set a watch, LORD, before my mouth. Keep the door of my lips.",
      "ko": "여호와여 내 입 앞에 파숫군을 세우시고 내 입술의 문을 지키소서",
      "source_text_hash": "5299dd10e183f0e37bcdba61661671e506e3fefd931b20bae6a815d5787eb940",
      "translation_text_hash": "fdd00279c8c231d53eabe4feecd31ee61eb528352cfc6c431d0b74ac179e4466",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
