      "en": "Their judges are thrown down by the sides of the rock. They will hear my words, for they are well spoken.",
      "ko": "저희의 관장들이 바위 곁에 내려 던지웠도다 내 말이 달므로 무리가 들으리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "6a8679bbb3b4ddae576e7a094ad3498b504a5b6aa5cb7ec67420db76dc7bd5f4",
      "translation_text_hash": "ecc27144c4b4b8d13610c27cb50927e88b821c041c3b56da57276a5cfe7422ff",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
