      ],
      "en": "Keep me from the snare which they have laid for me, from the traps of the workers of iniquity.",
      "ko": "나를 지키사 저희가 나를 잡으려고 놓은 올무와 행악자의 함정에서 벗어나게 하옵소서",
      "source_text_hash": "05c57361f5538f8abae3d342ea73113d807cbd4d51153c4ae795af59ed676fbf",
      "translation_text_hash": "5c9b4bf9ac33d9243da1de63f5720c0b645400b13cb6335a7e2a25acede408ad",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나를 지키사 저희가 나를 잡으려고 놓은 올무와 행악자의 함정에서 벗어나게 하옵소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5c9b4bf9ac33d9243da1de63f5720c0b645400b13cb6335a7e2a25acede408ad"
      ]
